# Changelog for minihomelib

## [Unreleased]

### Added

- Add user sessions using log-in mechanism (Flask-Login, passlib)
- Add user interface translations
- Add basic stats
- Add export to CSV
- Add per-book info pages
- Allow editing and deleting book info

### Fixed

- Fixed page autoreloading when adding a book using a barcode scanner
- Various CSS fixes

### Changed

- Enhanced UI: search (filter) and sort by column, book covers, new book arrivals
- Refreshed UI look using bundled Bootstrap
- Switched to flask.flash for message passing
- Switch to SQLite3 for book database
  - changed database schema: added table for book-related notes
- Switch to TOML for configuration

### Removed

## [0.1.0] 2022-11-09

### Added
- Initial release